xt-[11px] font-bold text-gray-700">רכיבה</span></button><button type="button" class="flex flex-col items-center gap-1 py-3 rounded-xl border-2 transition-all border-gray-100 bg-gray-50 hover:border-gray-200"><span class="text-2xl">⭐</span><span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-gray-700">אחר</span></button></div></div><div><label class="block text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 mb-1.5">תיאור קצר</label><textarea placeholder="ספר על הקבוצה שלך — מה עושים, מי מוזמן, מה האווירה..." rows="3" maxlength="300" class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 text-sm text-gray-900 placeholder:text-gray-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-cyan-400 resize-none leading-relaxed"></textarea><p class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 mt-1 text-left">0/300</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex-shrink-0 px-5 pt-4 pb-4 border-t border-gray-100" style="padding-bottom: calc(1rem + env(0px * , * safe-area-inset-bottom));"><div class="flex items-center gap-3" dir="rtl"><button aria-label="חזרה" class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center active:scale-90 transition-transform flex-shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right w-5 h-5 text-gray-600" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></button><button class="flex-1 h-11 rounded-xl bg-gray-900 text-white text-sm font-black flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-all active:scale-[0.97] disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed">המשך ליצירה<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-left w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div>
