קהילת בית ספר</span></span></button></div><p class="text-[12.5px] font-bold text-v2-deep">פרטית כברירת מחדל — אפשר לשנות בשלב הפרטיות</p></div></div></div><div class="flex-shrink-0 px-5 pt-4 pb-4 border-t border-v2-hairline" style="padding-bottom: calc(1rem + env(0px * , * safe-area-inset-bottom));"><div class="flex items-center gap-3" dir="rtl"><button aria-label="חזרה" class="grid h-12 w-12 flex-shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-white shadow-v2-ring transition-transform active:scale-90"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-5 w-5 text-v2-ink" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></button><button class="flex h-12 flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-v2-cta text-[16px] font-extrabold text-v2-on-cta shadow-v2-cta transition-transform active:scale-[0.97] disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40">המשך<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-left w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div>
