old leading-relaxed text-v2-ink-2">פנו לאגודת הסטודנטים ובקשו שישתפו פעולה עם Out — ואנחנו נפתח את הליגה הרשמית!</p></div><div class="rounded-[20px] bg-white p-4 shadow-v2-ring"><p class="mb-3 text-[15px] font-black text-v2-ink">איך זה עובד?</p><ol class="space-y-2.5"><li class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><span class="grid h-6 w-6 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-v2-tint text-[12px] font-black text-v2-deep">1</span><span class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-v2-ink-2">שלחו את ההודעה לאגודת הסטודנטים</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><span class="grid h-6 w-6 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-v2-tint text-[12px] font-black text-v2-deep">2</span><span class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-v2-ink-2">הם יצרו קשר עם Out</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><span class="grid h-6 w-6 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-v2-tint text-[12px] font-black text-v2-deep">3</span><span class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-v2-ink-2">הליגה הרשמית של הקמפוס נפתחת!</span></li></ol></div><button type="button" class="flex h-12 w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full text-[15px] font-extrabold transition-[transform,box-shadow,background-color] duration-150 ease-v2 active:scale-[0.97] bg-v2-tint text-v2-deep ring-1 ring-inset ring-v2-accent/40" disabled=""><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>נשלח! תודה</button><button type="button" class="h-11 w-full whitespace-nowrap rounded-full text-[14px] font-extrabold text-v2-muted transition-transform duration-150 ease-v2 active:scale-[0.97]">המשך ליצירת הקבוצה</button></div></div></div><div class="flex-shrink-0 px-5 pt-4 pb-4 border-t border-v2-hairline" style="padding-bottom: calc(1rem + env(0px * , * safe-area-inset-bottom