></path><path d="M22 10v6"></path><path d="M6 12.5V16a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-3.5"></path></svg></span><h3 class="text-[17px] font-black text-v2-ink">רוצים ליגה רשמית להקמפוס?</h3><p class="mx-auto mt-1.5 max-w-[290px] text-[14px] font-semibold leading-relaxed text-v2-ink-2">פנו לאגודת הסטודנטים ובקשו שישתפו פעולה עם Out — ואנחנו נפתח את הליגה הרשמית!</p></div><div class="rounded-[20px] bg-white p-4 shadow-v2-ring"><p class="mb-3 text-[15px] font-black text-v2-ink">איך זה עובד?</p><ol class="space-y-2.5"><li class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><span class="grid h-6 w-6 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-v2-tint text-[12px] font-black text-v2-deep">1</span><span class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-v2-ink-2">שלחו את ההודעה לאגודת הסטודנטים</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><span class="grid h-6 w-6 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-v2-tint text-[12px] font-black text-v2-deep">2</span><span class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-v2-ink-2">הם יצרו קשר עם Out</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><span class="grid h-6 w-6 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-v2-tint text-[12px] font-black text-v2-deep">3</span><span class="text-[14px] font-semibold text-v2-ink-2">הליגה הרשמית של הקמפוס נפתחת!</span></li></ol></div><button type="button" class="flex h-12 w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full text-[15px] font-extrabold transition-[transform,box-shadow,background-color] duration-150 ease-v2 active:scale-[0.97] bg-white text-v2-deep shadow-v2-ring"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-send h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.536 21.686a.5.5 0 0 0 .937-.024l6.5-19a.496.496 0 0 0-.635-.635l-19 6.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.024.937l7.93 3.18a2 2 0 0 1 1.112 1.11z"></path><path d="m21.854 2.147-10.94 10.939"></path></svg>שלח הודעה לאגודת הסטודנטים</button><button type="button" class="h-11 w-full whitespace-nowrap rounded-full text-[14px] font-extrabold text-v2-muted transition-transform duration-150 ease-v2 active:scale-[0.97]">המשך בלי לשלוח</button></div><div class="space-y-5 pt-4"><div><label class="mb-2 block whitespace-nowrap text-[13px] font-extrabold text-v2-deep">שם הקבוצה *</label><input type="text" placeholder="לדוגמה: קבוצת ריצה שכונתית" maxlength="60" class="h-12 w-full rounded-[16px] bg-white px-4 text-[15px] font-semibold text-v2-ink shadow-v2-ring outline-none placeholder:text-v2-muted focus:ring-2 focus:ring-v2-accent" value=""><p class="mt-1 text-left text-[11px] font-bold tabular-nums text-v2-muted">0/60</p></div><div><label class="mb-2 block whitespace-nowrap text-[13px] font-extrabold text-v2-deep">קטגוריה</label><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2"><button type="button" aria-pressed="true" class="h-11 truncate whitespace-nowrap rounded-full px-3 text-[14px] font-extrabold transition-[transform,box-shadow,background-color] duration-150 ease-v2 active:scale-[0.97] bg-v2-tint text-v2-deep ring-1 ring-inset ring-v2-accent/40">ריצה</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="h-11 truncate whitespace-nowrap rounded-full px-3 text-[14px] font-extrabold transition-[transform,box-shadow,background-color] duration-150 ease-v2 active:scale-[0.97] bg-white text-v2-ink-2 shadow-v2-ring">הליכה</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="h-11 truncate whitespace-nowrap rounded-full px-3 text-[14px] font-extrabold transition-[transform,box-shadow,background-color] duration-150 ease-v2 active:scale-[0.97] bg-white text-v2-ink-2 shadow-v2-ring">קליסתניקס</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="h-11 truncate whitespace-nowrap rounded-full px-3 text-[14px] font-extrabold transition-[transform,box-shadow,background-color] duration-150 ease-v2 active:scale-[0.97] bg-white text-v2-ink-2 shadow-v2-ring">יוגה</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="h-11 